2026-11-09T06:34:55.3168957Z ▶ event-driven Coordinator wakes need no minute sweep
2026-11-09T06:34:55.3170172Z   ✔ a producer's pending row starts the owner's wake after COMMIT, once per commit, never on rollback (177.500656ms)
2026-11-09T06:34:55.3172395Z   ✔ a row triage has not seen, written during a turn, is woken when the turn lets go (165.683108ms)
